BT /F2 16 Tf 72 710 Td (Chapter 2 – The First Star) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (The cloud carried Bo up past the rooftops,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (past the treetops, all the way to the stars.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (The first star Bo visited glowed a soft, lemony yellow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 608 Td ("I have a dream for you," said the star.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 590 Td ("A dream of running through warm summer rain.") Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 572 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 554 Td (The dream came in a tiny glowing bubble.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 536 Td (Bo held it carefully in both paws.) Tj ET
endstream
