BT /F2 16 Tf 72 710 Td (Chapter 3 – More Dreams) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (The next star gave him a dream of honey pancakes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 662 Td (The one after that, a dream of laughing with his best friend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 626 Td (Soon Bo had a whole armful of glowing bubbles,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 608 Td (each one warm, each one humming softly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 590 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 572 Td ("These are for keeping," the stars told him.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 554 Td ("And one — the brightest one — is for sharing.") Tj ET
endstream
